{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runback </strong>is a indie platform fighter where your character is different every game. Choose a character and play a first to three game online or locally. After each round go to the shop and purchase upgrades for your character from hundreds of choices. The loser of each round gets double the money to spend, so if you're tired of your friend always winning then this is the game for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Featuring:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200+ Unique Upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ Maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Near Infinite Customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local Multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Mode</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3286570?t=1759422958","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3286570?t=1759422958","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286570/c624ba473a8ef2e4f115e0357199075d48da6268/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759422958","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286570/c624ba473a8ef2e4f115e0357199075d48da6268/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759422958","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":